2-b5df-2a778d0ec556","source_start_index":216,"source_text":"十八年，命汉王谅将兵伐高丽，出临渝关。值水潦，馈运不继，而还。"}],"path":"北直方舆纪要/〇、封域 山川险要（卷十）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/〇、封域 山川险要（卷三十）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"大业七年，伐高丽，亦使来护儿自东莱入海趣平壤。唐贞观十八...","context_before":"...及渊灭，吴复遣羊褷击魏辽东，俘人民而去[详见南直大海]。","source_end_index":567,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"c7aac4b9-7e9f-54e2-9a4f-1ee9a6d64ee8","source_start_index":541,"source_text":"隋开皇十七年，伐高丽，使周罗睺分道自东莱泛海趣平壤。"}],"path":"山东方舆纪要/〇、封域 山川险要（卷三十）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/七、登州府（卷三十六）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"大业七年，下诏讨高丽，敕元弘嗣往东莱海口造船。八年，遣来...","context_before":"...，诏使者江法盛授高丽衣冠剑佩，魏光州兵就海中执之送洛阳。","source_end_index":234,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"daa947bc-0702-52c1-b9f4-903e1c567d53","source_start_index":188,"source_text":"隋开皇十七年，伐高丽，别将周罗睺自东莱泛海趋平壤[时郡境皆属东莱也]，遭风，船多飘没，师还。"}],"path":"山东方舆纪要/七、登州府（卷三十六）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/九、朝鲜（卷三十七）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"大业七年，讨高丽。明年，发二十四军分道并进，总集平壤，不...","context_before":"...，隋主赐玺书责其称藩，汤受命。会卒，子元嗣，隋仍封为王。","source_end_index":632,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"c28e9df9-8375-5908-be97-238cbd7f9e3c","source_start_index":593,"source_text":"明年，元帅靺鞨之众寇辽西，隋营州总管韦冲却之。隋因伐高丽，元遣使谢罪，乃罢兵。"},{"context_after":"大业八年，诏左右各十二军分道伐高丽，总集平壤。明年，复遣...","context_before":"...道，谓此。《隋书》：平壤城东西六里，随山屈曲，南临浿水。","source_end_index":215,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"7b6775e0-2607-5d2f-9e10-d5f6641924b3","source_start_index":183,"source_text":"开皇十八年，伐高丽，命周罗睺将水军自东莱泛海趋平壤，不能达而还。"}],"path":"山东方舆纪要/九、朝鲜（卷三十七）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事","外交"],"content":"4六月，丙寅，下詔黜高麗王元官爵。漢王諒軍出臨渝關，值水潦，餽運不繼，軍中乏食，復遇疾疫。周羅睺自東萊泛海趣平壤城，亦遭風，船多飄沒。秋，九月，己丑，師還，死者什八九。高麗王元亦惶懼遣使謝罪，上表稱「遼東糞土臣元」，上於是罷兵，待之如初。","content_fanyi":"六月二十七日丙寅，隋文帝下诏罢黜高丽王高元的官爵。汉王杨谅大军从临渝关出发，正逢大雨成灾，粮运不能接续，军中缺粮，又遇上瘟疫流行。周罗睺率领水军从东莱渡海直趋平壤城，也遭遇大风，船只大多漂散沉没。秋季，九月二十一日己丑，隋朝远征大军撤回，水陆两军死亡十之八九。高丽王高元也惶恐畏惧，派遣使者前来谢罪，上表自称“辽东粪土臣元”，隋文帝于是停止用兵，像当初一样对待他。","content_jianti_auto":"4六月，丙寅，下诏黜高丽王元官爵。汉王谅军出临渝关，值水潦，餽运不继，军中乏食，复遇疾疫。周罗睺自东莱泛海趣平壤城，亦遭风，船多飘没。秋，九月，己丑，师还，死者什八九。高丽王元亦惶惧遣使谢罪，上表称「辽东粪土臣元」，上于是罢兵，待之如初。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"，逆广复攻之而大败，其后唐太宗征之而丧师。广虽不道，来护...","context_before":"高丽，弱国也，","source_end_index":14,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"40586d62-dc99-48ec-a819-f117e2e9ed62","source_start_index":7,"source_text":"隋文攻之而不克"}],"title":"三 忧患则生安乐则亡"}],"id":17309,"number":4,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"b40d4087-db0e-11ef-9c0f-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"百濟王","people_name_jianti_auto":"百济王","people_xingming":"余昌","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b40e772e-db0e-11ef-b7a2-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[夫馀]"},{"people_name":"昌","people_name_jianti_auto":"昌","people_xingming":"余昌","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"b40e772f-db0e-11ef-abbb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"高麗","place_name_jianti_auto":"高丽","place_note":"首都平壤【朝鲜平壤市】","resolved_place_entity_id":226,"start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"b40e7730-db0e-11ef-b669-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"高麗","place_name_jianti_auto":"高丽","place_note":"首都平壤【朝鲜平壤市】","resolved_place_entity_id":226,"start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"b40e7731-db0e-11ef-8100-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"隋文帝攻高句丽之战","tongjian_id":"war_N0827"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/十、女真（卷三十七）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"《隋书》：百济出自东明，后有仇台者立，始强盛。杜佑曰：百...","context_before":"...击百济，为百济所败。八年，齐以其王牟大为镇东将军百济王。","source_end_index":249,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"58da7be4-66ce-5d28-b312-2eb118d17bdf","source_start_index":218,"source_text":"隋开皇十八年，遣使请伐高丽，愿为军导，高丽觉之，以兵侵掠其境。"}],"path":"山东方舆纪要/十、女真（卷三十七）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["外交","军事"],"content":"百濟王昌遣使奉表，請爲軍導，帝下詔諭以「高麗服罪，朕已赦之，不可致伐。」厚其使而遣之。高麗頗知其事，以兵侵掠其境。","content_fanyi":"百济王余昌派遣使者向隋朝奉上表章，请求充当征讨大军的向导，隋文帝下诏晓谕他说：“高丽已经服罪，朕已赦免高元，不可再行讨伐。”赠给百济使者丰厚的礼物，然后送他回国。后来高丽多少得知了这件事，便派兵侵犯掳掠百济边境。","content_jianti_auto":"百济王昌遣使奉表，请为军导，帝下诏谕以「高丽服罪，朕已赦之，不可致伐。」厚其使而遣之。高丽颇知其事，以兵侵掠其境。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":17310,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"b40e772d-db0e-11ef-baae-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"仁壽宮","place_name_jianti_auto":"仁寿宫","resolved_place_entity_id":1214,"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"b40ea16b-db0e-11ef-96df-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"5辛卯，上至自仁壽宮。","content_fanyi":"九月二十三日辛卯，隋文帝由仁寿宫返回京师。","content_jianti_auto":"5辛卯，上至自仁寿宫。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":17311,"number":5,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"b40ea16a-db0e-11ef-9e50-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"6冬，十一月，癸未，上祀南郊。","content_fanyi":"冬季，十一月十六日癸未，隋文帝到南郊祭天。","content_jianti_auto":"6冬，十一月，癸未，上祀南郊。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":17312,"number":6,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"b40ea16c-db0e-11ef-bfef-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"京師","place_name_jianti_auto":"京师","resolved_place_entity_id":43,"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"b40ea16e-db0e-11ef-b159-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"仁壽宮","place_name_jianti_auto":"仁寿宫","resolved_place_entity_id":1214,"start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"b40ea16f-db0e-11ef-a9a7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/三、凤翔府（卷五十五）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"唐贞观十八年，自九成宫还，至安仁宫，即此。后废]。","context_before":"○安仁宫[在县治东。","source_end_index":39,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"bfcaeb5a-e2c8-5ff2-b895-9b8c76b972bb","source_start_index":10,"source_text":"隋开皇十五年，置行宫十二所，自京师以达于仁寿宫。此其一也。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/三、凤翔府（卷五十五）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"7十二月，自京師至仁壽宮，置行宮十有二所。","content_fanyi":"十二月，隋文帝从京师长安到仁寿宫，设置了十二所行宫。","content_jianti_auto":"7十二月，自京师至仁寿宫，置行宫十有二所。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"，则其搜剔丁壮以供土木也，不待炀帝之骄淫，而民已无余地以...","context_before":"...，考其时，北筑长城，东巡泰岳，作仁寿宫，而丁夫死者万计，","source_end_index":334,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"df12381e-2bb4-4c16-bc13-031a100fa5d2","source_start_index":325,"source_text":"别宫十二，相因营造"}],"title":"一一 隋均田乃虐民之政"}],"id":17313,"number":7,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"b40ea16d-db0e-11ef-8337-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"讕，落干翻，又力誕翻。詆，拒諱也。讕，逸辭也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"谰，落干翻，又力诞翻。诋，拒讳也。谰，逸辞也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"b40ea172-db0e-11ef-ac67-a0d